\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Expectation and the pairing}
\date{2026-11-13}

\p{The Gaussian expectation #{\langle F\rangle_Q} is the pairing of the
law with the observable. Mathematical physics writes #{\langle O\rangle}
or #{\mathbb E[O]}. Geometric algebra writes #{\langle A\rangle} for
the scalar part of #{A}. The brackets are the same pairing as the
counting form. A grade projection carries its grade, #{\langle A\rangle_r}.}
